Z||000000||Raydar||07-31-2000||09:38 PM||||Just got back from vacation today. Found out our company is going through yet another "re-org". What that means is that they have got to cut costs. So the first thing they look at is personnel reductions. (8% in my department.) <BR>So... Am I going to be unemployed? Maybe. Hopefully not. More likely, I'll just change departments. The good side of that is that I won't be doing "end user" support, any more. (Yippee!!!) Which is okay. Starting to get boring. <BR>The bad side is that I will be subject to being called out at ungodly hours. (Doing microwave, fiber optics, and other broadband stuff.) <BR>Like I have a life, now. <P>Anyway, thanks for letting me whine. I am <I>very</I> much aware that it could be worse.<BR>Counting my blessings, and all.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR>88 Formula T-Top <BR>88 Coupe (ISO big V-6)<P>"Some mornings, it just isn't worth<BR>chewing through the restraints."||||reg||9
